{"type":"text","timestamp":1794564690279,"sessionID":"ses_e2ba44d2dffei3RDNKJhzvfSC8","part":{"id":"prt_1d46408c1002Ru0Dxe7uaUH6IY","sessionID":"ses_e2ba44d2dffei3RDNKJhzvfSC8","messageID":"msg_1d463fdc40012vjj3IBzxr89Hw","type":"text","text":"T007 is done. The advisor leg now reports the degraded share and the newest record time, and the absent-health reason names why no record exists. Both verify gates pass.\n\nFiles written:\n1. `.skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup.yaml` (line 59, advisor leg)\n2. `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/doctor-setup-contract.test.cjs` (the one test at lines 78 to 85 that pinned the old `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG` reason)\n\nVerify output:\n\n```\n$ rg -c \"SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG\" .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup.yaml\nSKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG rg exit=1        # no output, no match\n\n$ rg -c \"rollingDegradedRate\" .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup.yaml\n1\n\n$ rg -c \"hook health not recorded\" .skilled/commands/doctor/assets/doctor-setup.yaml\n1\n```\n\n```\n$ node --test .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/*.test.cjs\nℹ tests 1188\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 1188\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 194613.299667\nexit=0\n```\n\nThe advisor step now reads \"show hook p95 ... prompts, fail-open ..., degraded <rollingDegradedRate as a percent> and last record <lastRecordAt> under the leg.\" The absent branch reads \"show hook health not recorded under the leg, because no prompt hook has written a record for this checkout yet: OpenCode has no prompt hook that writes one and an unapproved Codex hook never runs.\" Both \"It never changes the leg's status.\" sentences remain. The test's old `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG` expectation is replaced by the full new sentence.\n\n`git status` lists only those two modified files. I did not tick T007 in `tasks.md`, and I touched no other file. Nothing is blocked on the operator, the orchestrator can record the checkbox and its receipt.","time":{"start":1794564688065,"end":1794564690279}}}
